  "tha-ap232:1.1": "Usabhaṃ pavaraṃ vīraṃ ",
  "tha-ap232:1.2": "Vessabhuṃ vijitāvinaṃ / ",
  "tha-ap232:1.3": "pasannacitto sumano ",
  "tha-ap232:1.4": "Buddhaseṭṭham avandi ",
  "tha-ap232:2.1": "'haṃ. // // Ekatiṃse ito kappe ",
  "tha-ap232:2.2": "yaṃ kammam akariṃ tadā / ",
  "tha-ap232:2.3": "duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi ",
  "tha-ap232:2.4": "vandanāya idaṃ phalaṃ. // // ",
  "tha-ap232:3.1": "Catuvīsamhi kappamhi ",
  "tha-ap232:3.2": "Vigatānanda-nāmako / ",
  "tha-ap232:3.3": "sattaratanasampanno ",
  "tha-ap232:3.4": "cakkavattī mahabbalo. // // ",
  "tha-ap232:4.1": "Paṭisambhidā . . . ",
  "tha-ap232:4.2": "pe . . . ",
  "tha-ap232:4.3": "pe . . . // // ",
  "tha-ap232:5.1": "Itthaṃ sudam āyasmā Ekavandiyo thero i. g. a-ti. Ekavandiyattherassa apadānaṃ samattaṃ. Uddānaṃ: Ālambanañ ca Ajinaṃ Maṃsad'-Ārakkhadāyako Avyādhi-Caṅkolaṃ Soṇṇam Miñjaṃ-Āveḷa-Vandanaṃ pañcapaññāsa gāthāyo gaṇitā ",
  "tha-ap232:6.1": "atthadassihi. ",
  "tha-ap232:7.1": "Ālambanadāyakavaggo tevīsatimo. ",
